        "TileImage": "$($repository 68c0eb1c-46c3-4b85-b000-205eb3839330).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.  Your targets are Grant Brie and Olive Haskel. The two were recently embroiled in an online controversy when, on their podcast  &quot;Speaking Of Freedom,&quot; they spent a segment mocking a trans woman named Abigail Forrest. After two months of nonstop harrassment in the wake of the episode, Abigail committed suicide. Our client, her partner, has requested we eliminate Brie and Haskel, putting an end to their hateful rhetoric. I shall leave you to prepare.\r\r-Diana",
